From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WinZapp <build@winzapp.invalid>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 13:26:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] deps: replace hypermeow with the local checkout (build)

The meowcaller library has moved to github.com/polymorfa/hypermeow.
Add the require and point the module at ../../hypermeow, which the
build clones and keeps in step with the other trees, so hypermeow
compiles at the same upstream HEAD the rest of the workspace tracks.
---
 goneonize/go.mod | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/goneonize/go.mod b/goneonize/go.mod
index aa814ca..17b6b6c 100644
--- a/goneonize/go.mod
+++ b/goneonize/go.mod
@@ -5,6 +5,7 @@ go 1.26.0
 require (
 	github.com/lib/pq v1.12.3
 	github.com/mattn/go-sqlite3 v1.14.52
+	github.com/polymorfa/hypermeow v0.0.0-20261112193137-7ced3258db46
 	go.mau.fi/util v0.10.1
 	go.mau.fi/whatsmeow v0.0.0-20260921121126-35ae40906e74
 	google.golang.org/protobuf v1.36.12
@@ -45,3 +46,5 @@ require (
 replace go.mau.fi/whatsmeow => ../../whatsmeow
 
 replace github.com/purpshell/meowcaller => ../../meowcaller
+
+replace github.com/polymorfa/hypermeow => ../../hypermeow
-- 
2.34.1

